Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was right in not avoiding her... wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, maybe it was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because her body was extremely, and unreasonably, light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. For her, Senjougahara,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the thing called weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,did not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though it's the cultural festival, we are already third years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't much we have to do seriously.\NBesides, preparing for the exams is also very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For starters, let's list some alternatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get everyone to cast their votes from there.\NHow's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. It seems somewhat democratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your tone is harsh as always, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I call you stubborn, or is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa Tsubasa, the class representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is law-abiding, well-mannered, extremely serious, and highly praised by teachers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The representative of all representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just for reference, what did you suggest for the cultural festival last year and the year before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ghost house and café.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And, as the vice-president, I'm discussing the plans for the cultural festival with Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, we have a student named Senjougahara in our class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san?\NWhat about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just concerned about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't she always take leave from school since her body is weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if she would even be participating in the cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, don't you agree that the name {\i1}Senjougahara Hitagi{\i0} is very strange and fascinating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara... that surname comes from the name of a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rather, I meant her other name...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara's given name is... Hitagi, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anything as strange as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:03.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Hitagi" sounds like civil engineering jargon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure know everything, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that I know everything.\NI just know what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How rare.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun is actually interested in someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boys always like girls that are physically ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, seriously...\NHow disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Physically ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, but is it really an illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless, what kind of a person is Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be more informed regarding things about her, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't the two of you been in the same class for three consecutive years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, she's an honors student with a clean record.\NHer grades are also pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've only been in the same class as her for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I don't know her that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Golden Week lies within that month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Golden Week, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh? What about Golden Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.\NCarry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san... She doesn't speak much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem to have any friends, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be due to her illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was livelier and more full of spirit during junior high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of junior high... Did you go to the same school as her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was really beautiful, good at sports, and the star of the track team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, I heard many rumors...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That she's a very good person who treats others kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently her father is an important figure in a foreign-owned business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She also seems to be living in a luxurious house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:17.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite that, she has never shown arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She sounds superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's inappropriate to say this, but Senjougahara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...looks more beautiful now than she did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fragile existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"A fragile existence"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I just remembered something.\NOshino told me to come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:58.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just to help with... some stuff at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa, can I leave the rest to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you promise to make up for it later, I'll agree to end it here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't keep Oshino-san waiting for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say hi to Oshino-san for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you discussing with Hanekawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I said that wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're free to move, but doing so will be very dangerous.\NThat's what I meant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Curiosity... such a thing can be compared to cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It swarms around the secrets that one doesn't want others to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's truly frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NIs your right side feeling neglected?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I must say, I was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really did not expect a banana peel to be at such a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You found out, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:11.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite what I said, I'm not entirely weightless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to my body shape and height, my average weight should be in the range of 45 kg and above.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my actual weight is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...5 kg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:35.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happened after I graduated from middle school and before I started high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I met a crab.\NIt completely stripped me of my weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's forgivable even if you don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm only telling you this since I find it inconvenient for you to stick your nose into it any further, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:53.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi Koyomi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me. What should I do if I want to render you unable to reveal my secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do for myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:12.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to make you swear not to reveal it, even if you were to be tortured and interrogated?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can I do to disable your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless, what I want is silence and ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:25.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you promise to stay silent and feign ignorance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nod your head twice, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any other action, including staying still, will be taken as an act of hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I shall act immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't scream.\NImpressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll let you off just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As of tomorrow, you are to ignore me, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's exactly like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:24.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's all right.\NThis type of injury means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you need to hurry over to Oshino-san's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:35.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa, do you like bananas?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh? Well, I guess I don't hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, they're nutritious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:43.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you insist on asking whether I like them or not, then yes, I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like them, never eat them in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay to eat just one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but toss the peel in the hallway, and I definitely won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:57.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what exactly are you talking about, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, hey, Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't run in the hallways!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll report this to the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.\NNo, I suppose I should say, "I'm surprised," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:28.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought that you'd be able put up such resistance after suffering from that sort of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no.\NI don't want a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't?\NThat's no fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I could be of help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop joking. What can you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only need to shut your mouth obediently and not say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I consider acts of kindness as hostility, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your wound...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:20.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... How can that be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino... Oshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. Oshino Meme.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, I became a human again instead of a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, there are still some aftereffects from when I was undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Oshino Meme?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name sounds very moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd be deceiving your feelings if that's what you're anticipating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a 30-year-old uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he must have been moe when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't use an approach like that to visualize real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, do you understand what "moe" and "character" are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're part of general education.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A character like me is known as a tsundere, am I correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd be more fitting to refer to you as a tundra.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My butt hurts. It feels numb.\NMy skirt is also crumpled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't push your responsibility. Be careful or I'll chop it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What part will you chop off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, where did you put your bag?\NYou're empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've stored my textbooks in my school locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, when your body conceals stationery, you don't need a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without going empty-handed, I cannot fight freely in the event of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll hold that stationery for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll guard it. Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino is said to be a weird uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, he's still my savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let him meet someone dangerous, so let me keep that stationery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You set me up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.\NTake good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:35.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't let my guard down against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "you haven't let your guard down"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep this in mind.\NMy five thousand barbarous comrades
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are stationed to attack your family if they don't receive contact from me every minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say a minute is enough to do {\i1}it{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:16:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I'm some kind of a boxer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of your sisters are still in middle school, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Don't even think that I'm thanking the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rather, you should be the one who's thankful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That stapler wound... In order for it not to be obvious...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:34.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I intentionally stapled it from the inside rather than from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the same logic as "to hide the wounds, hit the stomach instead of the face."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for the good of the attacker, not the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:43.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, regardless, it seems that I was worried over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I said, "Being undead is just so convenient," would you be offended?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now... I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm no longer undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:55.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that my wounds heal faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apart from that, I'm just like an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I'll say this once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's difficult to tell from my clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but my body might not actually be worth the price you'd pay for committing a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I say...? On the whole, you seem to be overly self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, you have quite a persecution complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, there are things you should and shouldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm impressed that this Oshino person manages to live in such a decrepit building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a rather weird person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's said that he specializes in people like you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Araragi-kun.\NYou're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a different girl with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.\NDon't set me up as some cheap person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm.\NNice to meet you, miss.\NI'm Oshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too. I'm Senjougahara Hitagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm classmates with Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard some things about you from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino, around two years ago, this girl{\fnArial}―{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please refrain from referring to me as "this girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, how should I address you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-sama~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't use such a robotic tone.\NSay it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch!\NYou trying to gouge my eyes out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.63,0:19:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rude comments are an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What type of equal exchange is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Copper: 40 g. Iron: 25 g.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nickel: 15 g. Concealing embarrassment: 5 g.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Add 97 kg of bad intentions, and you've got my statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was mostly just bad intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, that concealing embarrassment part was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just deleted the element that you shouldn't delete!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, before we start...\NWho is that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One without shape or shadow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:20:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A child which doesn't have a name and doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I gave her a name yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She worked pretty hard for me during the Golden Week
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh? You gave her a name?\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I named her Oshino Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heart under blade.\NThis name really suits her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her surname will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:22.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, what exactly is this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening? She's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The remains of a vampire.\NThe leftovers of a beautiful demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saying it like that is useless, but it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NIt's nothing major.\NThen I will forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help you?\NNo can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only one who can save you is yourself, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been fed that stage line by five other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of them were frauds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're just like them, Oshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure are feisty, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something good happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:08.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway...\NIf you don't tell me, there's nothing to be said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I keep secrets well. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, let me give the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need for that, Araragi-kun.\NI'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm able to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weight Crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weight Crab?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:32.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a myth from the mountains in the Kyushu region.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to different areas, Weight Crab is also known as Mind Crab or Heavy Crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, God of Emotions is another way of saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pun on kani and kami, which are crab and god.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... why Kyushu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The place doesn't have much unique significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the right conditions are met, it shall emerge there. That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this case, it doesn't necessarily have to be a crab.\NThere are also myths that they are rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... though I'm not talking about Shinobu-chan, there are also myths that they were beautiful girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like the face of the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, since you say you met a crab, miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this time it must be a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What exactly is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its name is of no value to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.09,0:22:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also mentioned it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.09,0:22:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could originally be a god, rather than a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, it diverged from God of Emotions to become Weight Crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are one of the fortunate ones amongst the unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gods are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are everywhere, but nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before you became like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it was beside you, yet not beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an ambiguous question and answer, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.99,0:22:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a Shinto matter. Oh, maybe it's Shugendou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be mistaken, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't become like this as a result of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only that the perspective changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perspective?\NWhat are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that your "oh, so pitiful" look makes me unhappy, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh, still so calm, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.30,0:23:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a spoiled little miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A majority of the people who encounter Weight Crab are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not something you can meet because you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:21.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interference with this god is uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncommon interference?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It merely exists there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't come true if you don't anticipate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.03,0:23:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rather, I don't want to dive too deep into this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.58,0:23:37.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless if it can be done or not, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.13,0:23:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wish to regain your weight, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.88,0:23:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, Araragi-kun recommended me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.07,0:25:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.98,0:25:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the worker ants,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The majority of them actually don't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.24,0:25:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The majority, 80%, don't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.91,0:25:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'll be pushing my work off onto others!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.99,0:25:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.91,0:25:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The worker ant has a name that just sounds pushy in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.91,0:25:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I guess you can't exactly call them slacker ants,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I've got a riddle for next week's preview.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:41.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Riddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Heat & Beat" refers to me but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It refers to you but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.92,0:25:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the name of the "&" symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The problem is that the riddle itself isn't hard. It comes from its phrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.71,0:25:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is obviously "ampersand!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.09,0:25:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.38,0:25:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time:\NHitagi Crab Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can only watch it if you solve this riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.59,0:25:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then no one will see it.
